# Clanker debug

Not skating. `?clanker=yes` or `?clanker=true` (case-insensitive) skips the pad gate, auto-starts, and maps keyboard plus mouse onto pad input. A real pad still wins when connected. Default URL stays pad-mandatory. Do not “fix” this away.

Code: `js/input/clanker.js`. Chip: CLANKER MODE. Stick HUD on by default (Z+X toggles).

Open **http://localhost:8000/?clanker=yes**.

Drag the stick HUD for analog feet. Two pointers can hold both. Release snaps to center. Keys fill any stick you are not dragging.

No Goofy. Regular: left foot on the nose, back pops. Switch: right foot on the nose, back pops. Nollie is Regular with the front foot popping. Fakie is Switch with the front foot popping. Options Stance and ○ flip Regular ↔ Switch.

| Keys | Pad |
|---|---|
| WASD | left stick |
| IJKL | right stick |
| F / Space | □ / × |
| E / Q | △ / ○ |
| Escape | Options |
| R | R1 |
| U / O | L2 / R2 |
| Arrows | d-pad |
| Z + X | L3 + R3 |

